[[File:TX225GAVr-HanSolo4.png|thumb|right|355x355px|A hovertank]]
A '''hovertank'''&mdash;or '''hover tank'''&mdash;also referred to as a '''repulsortank''', was a type of [[tank]] that ran on [[repulsorlift]]s. Types of hovertanks included:

*[[2-M Saber-class repulsor tank|2-M ''Saber''-class repulsor tank]]<ref name="Commander">''[[Star Wars: Commander]]''</ref>
*[[Armored Assault Tank Mk I]]<ref name="Cat and Mouse">{{TCW|Cat and Mouse}}</ref>
*[[Imperial Assault Tank|Assault tank]]s<ref name="Star Wars 3">[[Star Wars (2015) 3|''Star Wars'' (2015) 3]]</ref>
*[[Defoliator Deployment Tank]]s<ref name="Defenders of Peace">{{TCW|Defenders of Peace}}</ref>
*[[Multi-Troop Transport]]s {{C|hybrid}}<ref name="MTT Databank">{{Databank|mtt|MTT}}</ref>
*[[Separatist super-tank prototype|Super tank]]s<ref name="Landing at Point Rain">{{TCW|Landing at Point Rain}}</ref>
*[[T2-B Repulsor Tank]]s<ref name="Vader Down 1">[[Vader Down 1|''Vader Down'' 1]]</ref>
*[[TX-130 Saber-class fighter tank|TX-130 ''Saber''-class fighter tank]]<ref name="BFII">''[[Star Wars Battlefront II]]''</ref>
*[[TX-225 GAVr "Occupier" combat assault tank]]<ref name="The Occupation">{{Rebels|The Occupation}}</ref>
*[[TX-225 GAVw "Occupier" combat assault tank]]<ref name="Rogue One">''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref>
*[[Umbaran hover tank]]s<ref name="The General">{{TCW|The General (episode)}}</ref>
*[[Unidentified hovertank model]]<ref name="CSIRNAA">{{SkeletonCrew|Can't Say I Remember No At Attin}}</ref>
*[[WLO-5 speeder tank]]<ref name="The Gungan General">{{TCW|The Gungan General}}</ref>

